From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:29:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: Add PM clock definitions for SM8750

Add cpas_fast_ahb, cpas_ahb and gcc_axi_hf to the PM clock list for
SM8750. The CAMSS core enables them through the shared PM clock helper
when the device is probed.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261114-add-support-for-camss-on-sm8750-v7-8-8ff2a11835f6@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Wenmeng Liu <wenmeng.liu@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
index fe6165030c1872cdacbc73297cc787b8ddef9f94..44b2c97111151da136bfcd63ee14d63377962fd5 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
@@ -6094,6 +6094,7 @@ static const struct camss_resources sm8650_resources = {
 static const struct camss_resources sm8750_resources = {
 	.version = CAMSS_8750,
 	.pd_name = "top",
+	.pm_clks = { "cpas_fast_ahb", "cpas_ahb", "gcc_axi_hf" },
 	.icc_res = icc_res_sm8750,
 	.icc_path_num = ARRAY_SIZE(icc_res_sm8750),
 	.csiphy_num = 6,
